@startuml
title UML state chart diagram

state "Request" as Request
Request : entry/receive video suggestion request
Request : do/identify user

state "Gathering" as Gathering
Gathering : entry/user identified
Gathering : do/gather videos based on user's profile, preferences, trending videos, similar tags, genres, and promoted videos
Gathering : exit/videos gathered

state "Processing" as Processing
Processing : entry/videos gathered
Processing : do/add thumbnails and view counts to suggested videos
Processing : exit/suggested videos ready

state "Sending" as Sending
Sending : entry/suggested videos ready
Sending : send suggested videos to user
Sending : exit/suggestions sent

[*] --> Request
Request --> Gathering
Gathering --> Processing
Processing --> Sending
Sending --> [*]
@enduml
